{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787029934010355001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"runty-effectible-bluewhale","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":1,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"e586cac1e7b8822a8bcbc30f0aeecbebfe52f8804347e3b1991222dd5a142b4d","event_uuid":"be2573db-f634-4590-801c-5e07008d6024","position":{"commit_sha":"00041cc57c947b20c2254036a3e1b803795abc1a","position":"1787025712617194001-be2573db-f634-4590-801c-5e07008d6024"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787025712617194001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[],"description":"## Context\nThe RCA for tekite-fleece-hake found the same tracker-parent-as-code-root assumption in `src/rebar/_engine_support/commit_impact.py::code_root_for`. `attach_commits` reaches it through `_lib_mutations.py`; with an absolute `REBAR_TRACKER_DIR` outside the code checkout, valid code commit SHAs may be checked against the tracker parent and rejected. This is a confirmed construct/call path but was not dynamically reproduced during the bounded close-precheck investigation.\n\n## Plan\n- Reproduce attach-commits with a real code repo and independently relocated ticket store.\n- Confirm or reject tracker-parent root derivation as the mechanism.\n- If confirmed, add a real-git RED oracle, resolve code root from explicit/current repository context while retaining tracker reads, and perform mutation plus parity sweeps.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A deterministic experiment confirms or rejects the reported root-conflation mechanism.\n- [ ] If confirmed, valid code commits are accepted with an out-of-worktree tracker and unknown SHAs remain rejected.\n- [ ] Default in-repo tracker behavior remains green.\n- [ ] Focused tests, lint, and typecheck pass.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","57b6-90b7-87bb-45e7"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"57b6-90b7-87bb-45e7","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["cli","git","tracker"],"ticket_id":"9918-a5d6-8fb5-42e8","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Resolve attach-commits code root independently from relocated tracker storage","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["be2573db-f634-4590-801c-5e07008d6024"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787029934010355001,"uuid":"bcd322dd-3cca-4d22-a662-f673589214f3"}